Hi,

right now I committed a small change to alsamixer.
The following behavior is changed by this patch:

- [F5] key is used to toggle to the "All channels" view.
- After returning from the help/proc info window by [RET] key, the 
  previous view mode (playback, capture or all) gets back, while in
  the older version it was changed to "All" always.

IMO, this behavior is more straight-forward.
Let me know if you have other opinions.


Takashi


